n":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_dropoff","origin":[30.0,0.0,-58.0],"color":0,"uuid":"3be0b35f-5947-5bc9-b1a4-ad63495646ae","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"main_base_l4.png","name":"main_base_l4.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":256,"height":1024,"uv_width":256,"uv_height":1024,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"bfb58f3a-74fd-58b0-9661-0e2fd9727f6e","relative_path":"main_base_l4.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# main_base_l4\n\nMain base level 4, Stockade Hall: the parapet hall inside a tight timber palisade ring, entered through a gate tower.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -101..100, y 0..205, z -115..100 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 218, construction_0 43, construction_33 79, construction_66 195, ruined 225 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 120 x 192 x 116 (w x h x d) centred at x 0, z 10\n- palisade ring: four 6 u thick walls on a 200 x 200 square, 88 u tall (gap 40 u at the north gate)\n- gate tower: 60 x 160 x 32 centred at x 0, z -96\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l4_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l4_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l4` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -53)\n- `slot_parapet_1` at (-25, 154, -38)\n- `slot_parapet_2` at (25, 154, -38)\n- `slot_parapet_3` at (50, 154, -14)\n- `slot_parapet_4` at (50, 154, 34)\n- `slot_parapet_5` at (25, 154, 58)\n- `slot_parapet_6` at (-25, 154, 58)\n- `slot_parapet_7` at (-50, 154, 34)\n- `slot_parapet_8` at (-50, 154, -14)\n- `slot_gate` at (0, 0, -96)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (0, 104, -96)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (30, 0, -58)\n"}